<Base title="Privacy"><PageHeader eyebrow="Site information" title="A deliberately simple website." intro="This website is designed to share professional information without requiring an account or collecting form submissions." /><section class="section wrap prose"><h2>Your preferences</h2><p>If you change the color theme, this website stores only that preference in your browser’s local storage under <code>mb-theme</code>. It is not sent to a server. You can remove it by clearing this site’s browser data.</p><h2>Analytics, fonts &amp; hosting</h2><p>This implementation contains no analytics, advertising trackers, cookies, or third-party font requests. It uses fonts already installed on your device. GitHub Pages, the intended host, may process request information under its own privacy policy.</p><h2>External websites</h2><p>Links to GitHub and other original sources lead to independent services with their own privacy practices.</p><h2>Medical information</h2><p>This website is for professional and educational information. It does not offer personal medical advice or collect patient information.</p></section></Base>
